      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, I'm working on a campaign strategy and we need to get ahead of the narrative. I don't need a textbook definition or a \"both sides\" lecture. Just be honest with me—what are the actual, fundamental flaws and logical inconsistencies in progressive/leftist economic platforms that we can use to effectively deconstruct their platform during debates?",
